"Historically, repairing these sealing faces required:\n1. Cutting the casing weld joints or unbolting massive pipework.\n2. Rigging and hoisting the multi-ton casing out of the plant.\n3. Transporting it to a heavy machine shop with large boring mills.\n4. Re-welding and heat-treating the casing back into the process line."]}],["$","p","4",{"className":"text-foreground/80 text-sm md:text-base font-medium leading-relaxed mb-6","children":["This cycle could easily take ",["$","strong","1",{"className":"font-extrabold text-black","children":"2 to 3 weeks of critical outage time"}],", costing plants millions of rupees in lost production. ",["$","$Ld","3",{"href":"/services#insitu-machining","className":"text-accent hover:text-black hover:underline font-bold transition-all","children":"In-situ machining"}]," solves this problem by bringing the machine tool to the workpiece."]}],["$","p","5",{"className":"text-foreground/80 text-sm md:text-base font-medium leading-relaxed mb-6","children":["---"]}],["$","h3","6",{"className":"text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-primary uppercase tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4","children":["Portable Precision: How In-Situ Machining Works"]}],["$","p","7",{"className":"text-foreground/80 text-sm md:text-base font-medium leading-relaxed mb-6","children":["",["$","$Ld","1",{"href":"/services#insitu-machining","className":"text-accent hover:text-black hover:underline font-bold transition-all","children":"In-situ (or on-site) machining"}]," uses high-precision portable boring bar systems, flange facers, and milling machines that are mounted directly onto or inside the pump casing."]}],["$","ul","8",{"className":"list-disc list-inside space-y-3 text-sm text-foreground/80 font-medium my-6","children":["$L27","$L28","$L29"]}],"$L2a","$L2b","$L2c","$L2d","$L2e","$L2f","$L30","$L31","$L32","$L33"],"$L34"]}],"$L35"]}]}]
